# arrival / gain / addition (vriddhi)
came: vriddhi
arrived: vriddhi
found: vriddhi
added: vriddhi
bought: vriddhi
received: vriddhi
gained: vriddhi
got: vriddhi
joined: vriddhi
returned: vriddhi
appeared: vriddhi
grew: vriddhi
hatched: vriddhi
born: vriddhi
back: vriddhi
collected: vriddhi
picked: vriddhi
brought: vriddhi
